email.body:
Hi {business} team,

I'm {your_name} with {your_business}, a small web studio. I noticed {business} doesn't have a website on Google Maps, so people searching for {niche} in {town} find someone else first.

I already built a draft so you can see it. It costs nothing to look:
{demo}

If you like it, I can make it yours this week with your photos, your phone number and your own domain. {offer_line}

Would a 10-minute call this week work? Reply with a good time, or call me at {your_phone}.

{your_name}
{your_business} · {your_phone}
{postal_address}

This is a one-time business offer, sent because {business} is listed publicly as a local business. Reply "no thanks" and I won't write again.

Hi again,

Just making sure this reached you: the draft site I made for {business} is here:
{demo}

It works on phones, has tap-to-call and shows up properly when someone searches for {niche} in {town}. Happy to change anything you don't like before you decide.

{your_name} · {your_phone}
{postal_address}

Reply "no thanks" and I won't write again.

Hi,

I haven't heard back about the website for {business}, so I'll take that as not right now and won't keep emailing. The draft stays up for another week if you want to look:
{demo}

If the timing changes, my number is {your_phone}.

Thanks,
{your_name}
{your_business}
{postal_address}
